<title>BANGLADESH: Port conditions update - Bangladesh - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Bangladesh - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BANGLADESH, April 10 - Mongla - Loading and unloading of cargo from vessels was suspended from 1900, April 9, due to a sudden strike called by the barge owners' association.</p>
</text>
